<article class="env-definition" id="04NB">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/04NB">Definition <span data-tag="04NB">35.33.1</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{Q}$ be a property of morphisms of germs of schemes. We say $\mathcal{Q}$ is <em>étale local on the source-and-target</em> if for any commutative diagram </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ (U', u') \ar[d]_ a \ar[r]_{h'} &  (V', v') \ar[d]^ b \\  (U, u) \ar[r]^ h &  (V, v) }  \]
</div>
  <p> of germs with étale vertical arrows we have $\mathcal{Q}(h) \Leftrightarrow \mathcal{Q}(h')$. </p>
</article>